Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1278,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":577806,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":213298,"Name":"~Angela~","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1233364590,"LastPoster":{"Id":282827,"Name":"WeddingDayStory","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282827.jpg?_r=1431453768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":38,"Preview":{"Id":577806,"PostDate":1233364590,"PostContent":"Hi everyone,  I should check with the resorts but you girls are so knowledgeable I thought I woul...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.nutbrown@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1229911173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Angela~","Id":213298,"Name":"~Angela~","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86360a10ba67280c74b45a0a9686d5cc","RawContent":"Hi everyone,\n \n I should check with the resorts but you girls are so knowledgeable I thought I would post here first.\n \n Would it be possible to stay at the Riu Palace, and be married at Dreams? I am not sure of the distance between the 2 places and if it&#039;d be more of a hassle than anything else. \n \n These are my two choices for resorts at this point and I just read on another forum (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.myriuwedding.com\"&gt;My Riu Wedding &amp;gt; Home&lt;\/a&gt;) that the Riu does not allow outside photographers. We are planning on bringing a photographer from Canada. Have any of you had any experiences with the Riu and external vendors?\n \n Things keep pointing to Dreams telling me it&#039;s the one!!! It&#039;s just that it&#039;s more expensive than we&#039;d like our guests to have to spend just to get there. I have looked up prices for travel for July 2009 (a year from our wedding date) and it&#039;s about $2300 per person out of Toronto. Is it possible to negotiate rates with the hotel and work out a better deal than that? I am currently looking for a travel agent that specializes in DWs but so far no luck. I didn&#039;t hear back from any of the agents on this site.\n \n Thanks in advance for any info you can help out with!\n Ange","Attachments":[],"Id":577806,"PostDate":1233364590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone,<br \/> <br \/> I should check with the resorts but you girls are so knowledgeable I thought I would post here first.<br \/> <br \/> Would it be possible to stay at the Riu Palace, and be married at Dreams? I am not sure of the distance between the 2 places and if it'd be more of a hassle than anything else. <br \/> <br \/> These are my two choices for resorts at this point and I just read on another forum (<a href='http:\/\/www.myriuwedding.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>My Riu Wedding > Home<\/a>) that the Riu does not allow outside photographers. We are planning on bringing a photographer from Canada. Have any of you had any experiences with the Riu and external vendors?<br \/> <br \/> Things keep pointing to Dreams telling me it's the one!!! It's just that it's more expensive than we'd like our guests to have to spend just to get there. I have looked up prices for travel for July 2009 (a year from our wedding date) and it's about $2300 per person out of Toronto. Is it possible to negotiate rates with the hotel and work out a better deal than that? I am currently looking for a travel agent that specializes in DWs but so far no luck. I didn't hear back from any of the agents on this site.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks in advance for any info you can help out with!<br \/> Ange\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.nutbrown@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1229911173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Angela~","Id":213298,"Name":"~Angela~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21e347bcfdc55e89f1d7e2c55d427c10","RawContent":"Ok, so I just found something on that same website saying you CAN bring in an outside photographer and if they are not staying at the same hotel, they must have a day pass.\n \n I hate conflicting info!","Attachments":[],"Id":577812,"PostDate":1233365233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, so I just found something on that same website saying you CAN bring in an outside photographer and if they are not staying at the same hotel, they must have a day pass.<br \/> <br \/> I hate conflicting info!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.nutbrown@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1229911173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Angela~","Id":213298,"Name":"~Angela~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07aa5215bea8bafca09be415a0034e03","RawContent":"The day pass is correct. You can have any vendor you want at the hotel, but you have to arrange a day pass. Its $100 per head. They will have to provide identification and they have to be on the list of visitors for that day.\n \n Elaina","Attachments":[],"Id":577842,"PostDate":1233368486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The day pass is correct. You can have any vendor you want at the hotel, but you have to arrange a day pass. Its $100 per head. They will have to provide identification and they have to be on the list of visitors for that day.<br \/> <br \/> Elaina\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ms_worker@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232843966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214271.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Elainak","Id":214271,"Name":"Elainak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2d6633d950fc9adbeac477f37405321","RawContent":"Hi Ange\n \n The last time I worked with Riu, the bride was able to choose an outside vendor as long as a $100.00 USD day pass was paid, but rules change, you know? anyways, Mango Productions, the guys that have the exckusive at Riu are pretty good, I&#039;ve worked with them before and they&#039;re really really good.\n \n If you don&#039;t have a problem with the day pass you can bring your own photographer but if you do, you shouldn&#039;t worry that much, Jerome and company take some nice pictures too.","Attachments":[],"Id":577862,"PostDate":1233372761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ange<br \/> <br \/> The last time I worked with Riu, the bride was able to choose an outside vendor as long as a $100.00 USD day pass was paid, but rules change, you know? anyways, Mango Productions, the guys that have the exckusive at Riu are pretty good, I've worked with them before and they're really really good.<br \/> <br \/> If you don't have a problem with the day pass you can bring your own photographer but if you do, you shouldn't worry that much, Jerome and company take some nice pictures too.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@beautifulbajaweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232044680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213990.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BBW","Id":213990,"Name":"BBW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"befe572355289d22872fd46bc4d53ce7","RawContent":"I stayed at the Santa Fe next door. And we brought our photographer with us from the states. He was a guest so there was no day pass.","Attachments":[],"Id":577969,"PostDate":1233404416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I stayed at the Santa Fe next door. And we brought our photographer with us from the states. He was a guest so there was no day pass.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kerrington Danielle was born 6\/23\/09 12:31 pm 7lbs 14oz.<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i295.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm125\/2008bride\/IMG_9487.jpg\">http:\/\/i295.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...e\/IMG_9487.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klhanx@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1198079723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208049.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kelly C","Id":208049,"Name":"Kelly C","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a7c0a8e0af9f79ee061ae5c23ab2537","RawContent":"I live and photograph weddings here in Cabo. I continue to photograph weddings at both Rui Palace and Santa Fe, one as recently as last Wednesday at the Palace. The &#039;vendor fee&#039; is $100 at the Palace and $75 at the Santa Fe. To make it easier for couples booking non-resort photographers I pay half the fee and look after all the arranging for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":583488,"PostDate":1233841544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I live and photograph weddings here in Cabo. I continue to photograph weddings at both Rui Palace and Santa Fe, one as recently as last Wednesday at the Palace. The 'vendor fee' is $100 at the Palace and $75 at the Santa Fe. To make it easier for couples booking non-resort photographers I pay half the fee and look after all the arranging for you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"me@bradleyfraser.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1172157540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207211.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bradley Fraser","Id":207211,"Name":"Bradley Fraser","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8aead535e38fe4162770263b53cf932","RawContent":"Hi Ange,\n \n I am also confirming that I had no issues photographing weddings at the Riu Palace. I shot weddings there in 2007 and 2008 and I am going there again this April.","Attachments":[],"Id":587094,"PostDate":1234189189,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ange,<br \/> <br \/> I am also confirming that I had no issues photographing weddings at the Riu Palace. I shot weddings there in 2007 and 2008 and I am going there again this April.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"varyshka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1193053440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207873.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":74,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Varia","Id":207873,"Name":"Varia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2f221fe82b11dd9d9ef8e0754535c82","RawContent":"Everything I read is true, if your photographer comes with you as a guest I&#039;m pretty sure you won&#039;t have to pay a day pass, otherwise if you contract a local photographer you will have to pay the day pass.\n Jerome Dieu\/Mango Weddings\/Riu Palace house Photographers &amp;amp; Videographers","Attachments":[],"Id":587259,"PostDate":1234196201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Everything I read is true, if your photographer comes with you as a guest I'm pretty sure you won't have to pay a day pass, otherwise if you contract a local photographer you will have to pay the day pass.<br \/> Jerome Dieu\/Mango Weddings\/Riu Palace house Photographers & Videographers\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Jerome Dieu<\/strong><br><strong>Wedding Photographer<\/strong><br><br><span>Tel (from USA & Canada): 1 (925) 465 6146<\/span><br><span>Local Phone (Los Cabos): 104 3643<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mangoweddings.net\">www.mangoweddings.net<\/a><span>contact@mangoweddings<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mangoproduction@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1209737520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209252.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jerome Dieu","Id":209252,"Name":"Jerome Dieu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9851ca690b52627020e33f4811239d26","RawContent":"It\u00b4s a shame, you as a customer of such resorts, on top of it, you cannot have your own vendors unless you agree to pay more. Plus the photograhpy is the one thing you will have for the years to come, from that special day. \n \n It should be just the way you want it, so please don\u00b4t let the resorts do this to you. They should be instead concerned about providing a top notch service. After all it\u00b4s not everyday you get married.","Attachments":[],"Id":587389,"PostDate":1234201819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It\u00b4s a shame, you as a customer of such resorts, on top of it, you cannot have your own vendors unless you agree to pay more. Plus the photograhpy is the one thing you will have for the years to come, from that special day. <br \/> <br \/> It should be just the way you want it, so please don\u00b4t let the resorts do this to you. They should be instead concerned about providing a top notch service. After all it\u00b4s not everyday you get married.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moss@photoincabo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229366520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213198.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"moss","Id":213198,"Name":"moss","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40dc8c488a0c8fc5128e85a033143452","RawContent":"yes, this is true. i&#039;m getting married at the club RIU in Negril, jamaica in August. i was thinking of bringing a photographer from home but that didnt work out. we decided to hire an outside photgrapher who lives in Jamaica and all we have to do is pay for the day pass. i guess each RIU resort is different becasue i am paying $80 for the day pass.","Attachments":[],"Id":587505,"PostDate":1234209655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                yes, this is true. i'm getting married at the club RIU in Negril, jamaica in August. i was thinking of bringing a photographer from home but that didnt work out. we decided to hire an outside photgrapher who lives in Jamaica and all we have to do is pay for the day pass. i guess each RIU resort is different becasue i am paying $80 for the day pass.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idnun718@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1233249480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214441.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"inunez","Id":214441,"Name":"inunez","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"30425","Title":"Is this a possibility?\/No outside photographers at Riu Palace","LastPostDate":1469637647},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
