> User JulieDan2018 (287678)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.186.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1469637680,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"734f63204641753e2aaeb849b8f0c2fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bumping this for an update here- based on our experiences with resorts and what our WeddingDayStory couples tell us, this IS indeed a possibility, but, in most cases, it can be talked over with your resort&#039;s WP. If you absolutely don&#039;t want the resort photographers shooting your day, communicate with your wedding planner and let them know what you feel. If resort policy is not making you happy and you feel you are left without choice, that can affect your overall wedding experience and venues are very good at trying to compensate for these kinds of situations.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We hope our two cents help!&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The WeddingDayStory Family&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915060,"PostDate":1469637647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bumping this for an update here- based on our experiences with resorts and what our WeddingDayStory couples tell us, this IS indeed a possibility, but, in most cases, it can be talked over with your resort's WP. If you absolutely don't want the resort photographers shooting your day, communicate with your wedding planner and let them know what you feel. If resort policy is not making you happy and you feel you are left without choice, that can affect your overall wedding experience and venues are very good at trying to compensate for these kinds of situations.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We hope our two cents help!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The WeddingDayStory Family<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">WeddingDayStory Photo & Video<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>Celebrating the Simple Romance of Weddings in the Sun<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci5.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/MOi09NM6g9spojz5NLnMOwnb6-MW31M3aOTkQcwW8f3wdwfOUH0GzBEk8yCi-BgzM3hAdpIwrU1WHAJK7UztpSr8074FxfGAyPpdRVzR8Xe2Y3_la7JkoGjQ5fEMMlXrmCfTruiTWo--4VbfPoQOn-bX=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\" alt=\"home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\"><\/a>\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com'>Visit Our Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TMeXMn22qXFltX6DJDe_AEo_GCBXvZ0lfEoQ1N-sDj8MqXTEyHVSyjBY3N6gvfGOnEulCpGxzXZijcD_pU6C2X1YwSBuk1iBYjtSYRjFV3wTTKLSAQQj6Z2vAfG6_em0493VUojBKC0uQUVBLAM=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/facebook_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"facebook_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/WeddingDayStory'>Like us on Facebook for daily #BeachWeddingTips & Inspiration!<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.instagram.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/RWS9rjXymObP14zt_LiPSHwXQ3uPcgwH6AZT7qPuCu0Ka8ysDJENgx1lJiGofIj0aAIXDJgoZO9_6D1VvySkdovgOObcxndByrFDGd3aZ-7l2U9bYuo6e72ceD-8sM3fL7FT3Vxo9TciI2aqFFrE6X0t=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn0.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/social-set-2\/512\/UberCons_SocialPack_Instagram-20.png\" alt=\"UberCons_SocialPack_Instagram-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.instagram.com\/weddingdaystory'>WeddingDayStory's Instagram<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci3.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/BEs2VB5AHY8fFyGmyQwunFuNgmrNjTXQVpzxNP1EyVnTrGtgaqzYPqTxIRyXoRjpsYRW1sczzTV32ifhCpl9OtBt8lsmlYmIr25ECJziEcmPHiCXNXsi7X2eWTX5ZoEaDP82CIb_ajQxFQi6ew=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/twitter_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"twitter_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/WeddingDayStory'>Follow Us on Twitter<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/WeddingDayStory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci3.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/glAA6LOTxAKNN-UBWmQK8Xhf1S1UWklxsl-P151ZqApvRLXxEve692AoWIg1Ovkr7ChUpg-UGA7prQFa83wWZNbvF6-EfXDfa482daVmplpp3mbHXjOMAG2JDZAObzQTE1mFxzgeWdV4vkLWXvInmyHLlY-0JXmsYC6R4ToKwVSQDsZOuu8=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1054.photobucket.com\/albums\/s495\/weddingdaystory\/Transparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_zpscrfyjxqm.png\" alt=\"Transparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_\"><\/a>\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/es.pinterest.com\/weddingdaystory\/'>Follow Our Pinterest Boards For Destination Wedding Inspiration<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/reviews\/weddingdaystory-playa-del-carmen-guanacaste\/a22bb30fa39d365c.html'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/Yn8ddso_hGdrAOxFk0Zr2iPASI0Zf2mQmXGnilQfDqIhUWXveEKq4WVegJEZRBkWN8OdepvzwiyU5CXXSuIGpLjZp5sIj1x_fVQaWblobBC1KpwPogokAH4gHd56anNO0lfoarqq3ahajmY=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\" alt=\"WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\">Read Our #WeddingDayStoryCouples Rave<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TgfKCWnrqjAdFkF1u1HLssLiSur_iZGjmMLyrzdhfDL8SIuxweTCVlTuAZDJ1eHujXOiJClqqY4Wj3-RgkRBc8v8fvn-52xdcngb7E6GsyJjfErN_nogFD07qKQSMbchiP8mQg=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/linkedin_zpsji7hbqld.png\" alt=\"linkedin_zpsji7hbqld.png\"><\/a><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/weddingdaystory'>Find Us on Linkedin<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Office (MX): +52 984 148 8653 \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Skype: WeddingDaySt