stinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msncry.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sent several emails and nothing!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gygarrido@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.4.112.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359227142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265139.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Gyqueiroz","Id":265139,"Name":"Gyqueiroz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f35373e7cd9660c5c68a7b9465e4bc0","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsullivan86[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Girls! \n \n I&#039;m back from my Wedding at Dreams! I wanted to post some pics until I can write a full review :) It was more than we ever dreamed of!!!!! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170525\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170526\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n We are the first people EVER to get married in this spot!!!!!! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170527\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170528\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170529\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170530\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170531\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170532\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n Cake by Dessert Diva- tasted AMAZING! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170533\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n White Dance Floor \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170535\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170536\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n First Kiss! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170537\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n \n Your pictures are amazing!! Maybe I should have read more through the thread here but where did your ceremony take place?","Attachments":[],"Id":1748482,"PostDate":1366363795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jsullivan86<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/76522\/dreams-los-cabos-bride-roll-call\/40#post_1832449' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Girls!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm back from my Wedding at Dreams! I wanted to post some pics until I can write a full review <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It was more than we ever dreamed of!!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170525\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170525\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170525\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170526\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170526\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170526\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> We are the first people EVER to get married in this spot!!!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170527\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170527\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170527\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170528\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170528\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170528\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170529\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170529\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170529\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170530\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170530\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170530\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170531\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170531\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170531\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170532\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170532\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170532\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> Cake by Dessert Diva- tasted AMAZING!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170533\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170533\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170533\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> White Dance Floor<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170535\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170535\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170535\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170536\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170536\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170536\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> First Kiss!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170537\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"170537\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/170537\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Your pictures are amazing!! Maybe I should have read more through the thread here but where did your ceremony take place?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><em><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span>Marrying My 5th Grade \"Boyfriend\"...Life has a funny way of working itself out <span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trina2103@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.154.15.214","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1340620230,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257115.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Melissa14","Id":257115,"Name":"Melissa14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b566cdf9d7c6e07dc4a064c3dd854006","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Johanna,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I sent them many emails and did not get back from them at all!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Im doing it on Melia...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; But Dreams has a nicer package that included the pictures, and I really wanted that. Ho Well it is all good Im bringing my photographer now. I have many photographer friends so it is not as a big of a deal!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1754164,"PostDate":1367578611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Johanna,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I sent them many emails and did not get back from them at all!\u00a0<\/p> <p> Im doing it on Melia...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But Dreams has a nicer package that included the pictures, and I really wanted that. Ho Well it is all good Im bringing my photographer now. I have many photographer friends so it is not as a big of a deal!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gygarrido@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.4.112.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359227142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265139.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Gyqueiroz","Id":265139,"Name":"Gyqueiroz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35d16feff0eca9cf7733e71717365870","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Gyqueiroz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Johanna, \n \n I sent them many emails and did not get back from them at all!  \n Im doing it on Melia... \n \n But Dreams has a nicer package that included the pictures, and I really wanted that. Ho Well it is all good Im bringing my photographer now. I have many photographer friends so it is not as a big of a deal![\/quote] \n Wow, that&#039;s unfortunate. I&#039;m sorry! Melia is gorgeous too! That&#039;s great you have many photographer friends. One less thing to worry about! have you picked your dress out yet??","Attachments":[],"Id":1755796,"PostDate":1368013215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Gyqueiroz<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/76522\/dreams-los-cabos-bride-roll-call\/60#post_1902233' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Johanna,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I sent them many emails and did not get back from them at all!\u00a0<\/p> <p> Im doing it on Melia...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But Dreams has a nicer package that included the pictures, and I really wanted that. Ho Well it is all good Im bringing my photographer now. I have many photographer friends so it is not as a big of a deal!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Wow, that's unfortunate. I'm sorry! Melia is gorgeous too! That's great you have many photographer friends. One less thing to worry about! have you picked your dress out yet??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jo_hannam@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.240.208.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1360166458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"